  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "三十一日，他背着行李，赶到集训的集合点。",
      "sha256": "69155feefb6439d3fbf924d14e7b06886376120722df578ee6bf011930f29190",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.258,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.742
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "而他身后的家，三楼的窗，始终暗着。",
      "sha256": "13649ce06d49ef13f56aeef20413304fa71950d8c2a2cb09b87d024f4f2c77c0",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.467,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.533
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "要讲清这一天，得回到十二月三十日，那个普通的下午。",
      "sha256": "1c41b4922e268f44fafabf2d9a0af8ccefcbeac44b1cc028c08c66e976f737e8",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.747,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.253
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "东京涩谷，这户人家的父母都是牙医，家里一向干净、安静。",
      "sha256": "0351866d0077146dc742744c0ddd34b3dbacd521033d7f34965eceab69045ea7",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.348,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.652
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "长子读牙科，次子勇贵二十一岁，还在复读备考。",
      "sha256": "b9ecf871de3a07171c5ddf1c15793c4454f566d570cbb5638bae59434f31789f",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.557,
      "atempo": 1.0928,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "妹妹亚澄二十岁，读短期大学，也喜欢表演。",
      "sha256": "80a41acdde68d6ec8ad8624be0a6db9d779a99d9d6c5af504977ccc60a89dc82",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.251,
      "atempo": 1.0501,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "三十日下午，母亲和长子拉着行李出门，回福岛过年。",
      "sha256": "3c510bcb5019f0ae56be500ede4bf723f6364f25a2a12978fe6ce54d0128afff",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.635,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.365
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "父亲随后也出了门。门一关，家里只剩兄妹两人。",
      "sha256": "d31ecfcb413449e88835d3de0abf178ec4a338456cb226eea2cba82cbd6f5e10",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.859,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.141
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "门里再没有第三个人。之后的经过，只有他的说法。",
      "sha256": "5630d24c14d27015231802373418b6c4a9fb7889319eb861743ed9ce9736a065",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.747,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.253
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "他说，争执中，她讲了一句：你没有梦想。",
      "sha256": "81e9e3dd585e06514ad57d5491987daca64d6d80caaf7e43c1f870150e50ea47",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.146,
      "atempo": 1.0292,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "那天下午，亚澄在那扇门后遇害。动手的人，是她的哥哥。",
      "sha256": "6f106bdfba237648f5c840d5fef45881942cca0f3cbd0ce2d9db88b1b8d5a4d2",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.766,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.234
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "他关上门，把真相留在了屋里。屋里再没有别的声音。",
      "sha256": "219f34f99adece7b0fc407409aed24a074d92d6f1a472fa26439a7a3f87ab21b",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.851,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.149
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "手机拿起，又放下。他没有报警，也没有离开。",
      "sha256": "2cf04e5f452336ee5da3e09871abce06423f92c7c3e7c5b7cac4f680ae5029de",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.624,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.376
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "更反常的，是第二天：他照常起床，照常出门。",
      "sha256": "4fefe75c9a9ec3d78c68c3c456880eefb9cec8c0173291e678b69346473e629a",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.251,
      "atempo": 1.0501,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "十二月三十一日，他收拾行李，准备去集训。",
      "sha256": "22536db6ba8fa0b3cf5315646f2712ce4355d6c2358b601eea90934395d0ff30",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.18,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.82
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "他背着包，独自走向集合点。",
      "sha256": "34d39df375a159fc0da0e96f05ff7d728e4f80063a31d88c499d7001bd78d03f",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 2.926,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 3.074
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "上车，出发。看上去，和往年没什么两样。",
      "sha256": "6af4bb9ae6a508b529cb7cff01b8989ec0d58343872c03744f946eff4eb239be",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 97,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.258,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.742
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "而家里的那扇窗，一直暗着。",
      "sha256": "b3c413ca1976b5a0fb4b9c276b00cffb294491362882902f31a7b9c0e09d083b",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 103,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 2.926,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.074
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "一月二日，家人结束返乡，一起回到东京的家。",
      "sha256": "9e66ef29087496225e4eac01edd75882d4d96425f884b478528d99a6f26deaf4",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.545,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.455
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "直到三日晚，母亲在走廊停下——她闻到一股异味。",
      "sha256": "e09c971d5607512ecbd9727429901344d8c0e9d5be6b251d20b977883d63e728",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.433,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.567
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "她走上三楼，停在儿子的房门前。",
      "sha256": "cdaa3fa5fe0e9dce823a53a1f44614e56bd6b4ea28f7a34126f26a09c9dff63e",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.736,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.264
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "门开了。第二天一早，刑警在集训地找到勇贵。",
      "sha256": "32d1e74aa02d10fa011cb9de6bf619daba4d0b16e2efb4a47606fa8badb8be8a",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 125,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.068,
      "atempo": 1.0136,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "审讯室里，他先否认，后来承认。可真正的争议，才刚开始。",
      "sha256": "edb3f4abf2357b7d39bc15d1bf26eb4d08d7b600b7c09b86645233ca703516a5",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.079,
      "atempo": 1.0113,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "法庭要判断的，不只是他做了什么，还有他当时能不能负责。",
      "sha256": "5115e179a1537bbc27026127652b42202feaaf64c4018538c42a1d1ca20ac0a0",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 137,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.348,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.652
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "辩方主张，那一刻是另一个人格控制了他。",
      "sha256": "4febf2c1ff547ad7d4bd4c6ab50bf6bdb7784703cb1c88c6fac66a3b44a5940f",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.251,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.749
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "一审七年。杀人罪成立，另一项因责任能力判无罪。",
      "sha256": "ad88f70114ef6ab2dafae494b64a252e17fe18b1ce2a9abc882754068b0e6f34",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.269,
      "atempo": 1.0449,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "二审却发现，他在侦查时，能把经过讲得很清楚。",
      "sha256": "58a18c6f525b407f3c2871beb9625fb82a1cb3d8169e79932d4cbbe3a907dcd4",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.825,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.175
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "失忆的前提被推翻。两罪成立，改判十二年。",
      "sha256": "1ad5b044dafd648985c467af1fa1a1aaeced5f1049ea1d6d49dcfc48d5439af0",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.355,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.645
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "亚澄的人生，不该被缩成一句话。责任，在施暴者。",
      "sha256": "2a6c2d77c9ee83439c4d27109a603e405dd7cc5b6ebd36e4b3c84568bb1c89e6",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "target_start": 168,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.269,
      "atempo": 1.0449,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
